        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>狗狗训练 - 稳定随行 / 拒食训练</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  body {\n    background: #fdf0e6;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"Kaiti SC\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    color: #3a2b1c;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fdf0e6;\n    padding: 14px 16px 20px 16px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .section-head {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  .badge {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 2px solid #4a3a2a;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    padding: 4px 10px;\n    font-size: 24px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    color: #2f2418;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .subtitle {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #4a3a2a;\n    background: linear-gradient(transparent 60%, #cfe8b8 60%);\n    padding: 0 2px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .content-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n  .dog-col {\n    flex: 0 0 110px;\n  }\n  .text-col {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n  }\n  .para {\n    margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  .full-text {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    margin: 10px 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  .hl {\n    background: #f7d9e3;\n    padding: 0 1px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    border: 1px dashed #b9a78f;\n    background: #f7ead9;\n    color: #7a6a55;\n    font-family: \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .dog-ph {\n    width: 110px;\n    height: 130px;\n  }\n  .walk-ph {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 105px;\n    margin: 6px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  .divider {\n    border: none;\n    border-top: 2px dashed #c9b49b;\n    margin: 10px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- Section 1 -->\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\n    <span class=\"badge\">稳定随行</span>\n    <span class=\"subtitle\">训练狗狗跟着人走而不是人跟着狗走</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-row\">\n    <div class=\"dog-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder dog-ph\">[Illustration: cartoon corgi dog, left side]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-col\">\n      <p class=\"para\">①前期可以选择靠墙位置，用玩具或零食吸引狗狗注意力在人身上</p>\n      <p class=\"para\">②如果狗狗出现前冲或者爆冲行为，<span class=\"hl\">主人要握紧牵绳，原地保持不动</span>，或者右转90度，让狗狗走在你身后</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"full-text\">③狗狗一旦回头找你或者牵引绳恢复了松弛状态，你再继续走，重复多次</p>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder walk-ph\">[Illustration: three panels of a person walking a beagle on leash, centered]</div>\n\n  <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n  <!-- Section 2 -->\n  <div class=\"section-head\">\n    <span class=\"badge\">拒食训练</span>\n    <span class=\"subtitle\">训练狗狗不随便在外面捡东西吃</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-row\">\n    <div class=\"dog-col\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder dog-ph\">[Illustration: cartoon corgi dog sitting, left side]</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-col\">\n      <p class=\"para\">①<span class=\"hl\">戴</span>上牵引绳，将狗狗爱吃的零食放在手上，当它想吃的时候，<span class=\"hl\">拉绳子说NO</span>,并握紧食物，反复训练直到狗狗看到手中食物就避开</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"full-text\">②当狗狗能做到在手里的食物可以成功拒食后，可以把食物放在地上，带狗狗经过，狗狗嗅闻的时候，拉绳子说NO，直到狗狗无视地上食物</p>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
